Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:36.89,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de lo externo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.89,0:00:37.70,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}Mover tu cuerpo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:38.60,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}muy importante
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.18,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}El ejercicio
