Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.40,0:00:41.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}mueven la energía
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:42.00,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}que se ha mantenido durante
