Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:46.95,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de los demás y siempre
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.95,0:00:48.14,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}te comparas por debajo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:48.79,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}y ves lo peor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.79,0:00:48.94,B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,1415)}de ti
